  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core contribution to UNDP FY26/27 &#x2013; FY28/29 (All ODA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme provides core funding to the United Nations Development Programme (UNDP) which directly supports key HMG priorities, including climate change, governance and gender equality. This programme will support UNDP to deliver on its cross-cutting mandate and facilitate UNDP&#x2019;s pivotal role in UN80, UN reform, and the wider global development architecture. Specifically, the core funding will support the implementation UNDP&#x2019;s 2026-2029 Strategic Plan to deliver the Sustainable Development Goals.</narrative>
  </description>
